":"陈献章","text":"溪槎汎汎月中眠，横占波间一半天。\n何许少年三五辈，夜深邻舫叫摊钱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42040,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"半江十咏为谢德明赋 其八","author":"陈献章","text":"碧海云深鹤梦劳，人间无地著卢敖。\n不知居士曾来否，试向波心问小舠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42041,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"半江十咏为谢德明赋 其九","author":"陈献章","text":"醉则高歌醒复悲，老仙那有独醒时。\n江间波浪三千顷，都与回公入酒卮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42042,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"半江十咏为谢德明赋 其十","author":"陈献章","text":"半江秋水映斜阳，几个神仙坐水旁。\n酒是逡巡花顷刻，一尊韩愈对韩湘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42043,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"经陈氏家庙","author":"陈献章","text":"牡蛎墙高一庙深，缘冈松柏昼阴阴。\n我家俎豆茅茨下，只少黄金不少心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42044,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题万松庵壁","author":"陈献章","text":"昔年曾赋万松轩，一饭松根有俗缘。\n旋摘黄花傅白酒，真成东老对回仙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42045,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过东涌","author":"陈献章","text":"乡曲论交大父馀，耳根狼籍病翁书。\n小儿莫道无灵性，也傍寒塘望笋舆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42046,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"经曝日台","author":"陈献章","text":"何处猿声更断肠，夜闻孤女哭凄凉。\n泪痕滴著台旁树，纵到春风亦少芳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42047,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄袁晖林敬 其一","author":"陈献章","text":"颇忆江湖林子翼，小斋留饭更袁晖。\n人心人面人人异，贤辈如前共饭时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42048,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄袁晖林敬 其二","author":"陈献章","text":"南州香匮久流传，亦卖东湖草屦钱。\n莫共诸贤理铅椠，只治香匮过年年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42049,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄袁晖林敬 其三","author":"陈献章","text":"岁首诗缄寄草梅，路傍先倩秉之开。\n而今两眼西风泪，谁解传声到夜台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42050,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄袁晖林敬 其四","author":"陈献章","text":"若道鸱夷解了心，五湖何用更千金。\n鲁连长揖平原去，风月无边碧海深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42051,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"林缉熙县博张廷实进士何孝子子完先后见访既而缉熙往平湖廷实归五羊子完还博罗因赋四绝 其二","author":"陈献章","text":"昨夜江门把春酒，满船明月唱阳关。\n五羊城中消息断，君去东吴几日还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42052,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"林缉熙县博张廷实进士何孝子子完先后见访既而缉熙往平湖廷实归五羊子完还博罗因赋四绝 其三","author":"陈献章","text":"四百峰头白鹤知，老夫八月有幽期。\n尔家正在罗浮下，莫向春风怨别离。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42053,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"林缉熙县博张廷实进士何孝子子完先后见访既而缉熙往平湖廷实归五羊子完还博罗因赋四绝 其四","author":"陈献章","text":"长髯遗我一囊山，铁桥流水非人间。\n我今决策山中去，踏断铁桥无路还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42054,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梦游天台","author":"陈献章","text":"路入天台第八重，洞门刚与赤城通。\n脚根点到虹桥下，一笑那知是梦中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42055,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"伍伯饶送蜂窼至用韵答之 其一","author":"陈献章","text":"独怜溪竹隐花丛，待得南山后到蜂。\n昔日往来南谷口，如今只用一丸封。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42056,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"伍伯饶送蜂窼至用韵答之 其二","author":"陈献章","text":"晚蜂队队过山房，何处归来嘴脚香。\n辛苦奉君臣子分，可堪奴辈日偷尝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42057,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赛兰花开 其一","author":"陈献章","text":"晴光三日转花枝，坐对微馨忽有诗。\n涓滴未尝花上露，南风莫只报人知。","collec