01baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"何生告还新喻因忆希仁先生平生故人不相见十有六年怅然有作附生它日见之为我道之","author":"陈献章","text":"忽忽人间十六年，与公信息两茫然。\n不知今日江门路，还到湖西是几千。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42083,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"渊明爱菊","author":"陈献章","text":"白衣刚到黄花下，醒长官为醉长官。\n社里新知僧酒主，门前高枕石蒲团。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42084,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和靖爱梅","author":"陈献章","text":"懊恼梅花未有诗，孤山马上又攒眉。\n后人拈出前人句，作者元来自不知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42085,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"茂叔爱莲","author":"陈献章","text":"不枝不蔓体本具，外直中通用乃神。\n我即莲花花即我，如公方是爱莲人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42086,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"潘岳爱桃","author":"陈献章","text":"潘郎本自爱桃花，种向河阳几万家。\n世有长官如孟子，还除花地付桑麻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42087,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"废宅逢梅","author":"陈献章","text":"花间无主竹篱空，小径斜穿曲巷通。\n赖是暗香能不息，短筇破帽得相逢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42088,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与客夜饮","author":"陈献章","text":"击节歌声未出门，照书灯火已眠尊。\n老妻唤醒蒲团梦，更与殷勤煮菜根。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42089,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"辞徵文者","author":"陈献章","text":"平生语默鬼神知，破戒随人老可媸。\n三日裹粮无此客，手携空卷下阶迟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42090,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"崔潜送菊坡先生遗像至适乡人送紫菊一株遂以答之","author":"陈献章","text":"高风千古镇浮华，儗酌寒泉荐菊花。\n江上一株红带雨，丹青同日到山家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42091,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舫子","author":"陈献章","text":"此身天地一虚舟，何处江山不自由。\n六十一来南海上，买船吹笛共儿谋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42092,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"木犀 其一","author":"陈献章","text":"晓枕东窗睡不来，木犀造次隔篱开。\n阿田拍手黄鹂到，写尽春风得意杯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42093,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"木犀 其二","author":"陈献章","text":"东风披拂满林塘，脚债东山也未偿。\n扪虱不禁春意动，日华初吐木犀香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42094,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"木犀 其三","author":"陈献章","text":"茗碗朝朝怕侍儿，采花莫采称心枝。\n床敷爱就东窗暖，分付东风敌面吹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42095,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"木犀 其四","author":"陈献章","text":"人间花草斗春肥，粉蝶黄莺接翅飞。\n也爱白头肝肺好，木犀墙下咽朝晖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42096,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"木犀 其五","author":"陈献章","text":"名花得见太平年，击壤声高压管弦。\n化日熙熙春荡荡，华夷何处不同天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42097,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"木犀 其六","author":"陈献章","text":"白头无酒不成狂，典尽春衫醉一场。\n只许木犀知此意，晚风更为尽情香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42098,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"书易隐求铭旌后感而有作 其一","author":"陈献章","text":"一题八字八低回，满眼凄凉笔下来。\n春社去年人不见，茅檐燕子又飞来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42099,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"书易隐求铭旌后感而有作 其二","author":"陈献章","text":"山林交分晚相投，诗在寒江紫菊舟。\n君去落英还对我，独吟春雨看江流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42100,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"书易隐求铭旌后感而有作 其三","author":"陈献章","text":"半雨半晴莺乱啼，溪边丈人还杖藜。\n不见旧时游走伴，白头冲雨更冲泥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42101,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"移海棠花","author":"陈献章","text":"小朵轻红带雨香，柔条深翠引风长。\n道人不是看花客，肯把墙隈借海棠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42102,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晓饮忽醉拥禅衣坐睡","author":"陈献章","text":"三杯过卯得瞢腾，坐拥禅衣问杀更。\n下砌握刀山竹冗，开门负水海棠生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42103,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"弄笔 其一","author":"陈献章","text":"白日一醒尘土梦，青山谁计髑髅春。\n时当可出宁须我，道不虚行只在人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42104,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"弄笔 其二","author":"陈献章","text":"弄水忘归真洒脱，看山扶步小逡巡。\n等閒未许丹青手，搭飒平生画此中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42105,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鸲鹆育雏于贞节堂东壁壁高且危二雏堕地下乃就而哺之悲鸣徬徨如在无人之境予怜之取雏纳之巢纪以是作 其二","author":"陈献章","text":"海鸥来往未忘机，鸲鹆能言掠砌飞。\n母去巢危雏落尽，衔虫巢畔待雏归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42106,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江上","author":"陈献章","text":"迟迟春日满花枝，江上群儿弄影时。\n渔翁睡足船头坐，笑卷圆荷当酒卮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42107,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"有怀故友张兼素 其一","author":"陈献章","text":"穆穆熙熙只此风，今人未见古谁同。\n意中我了牛医子，且放山斋水墨中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42108,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"有怀故友张兼素 其二","author":"陈献章","text":"长安风雨闭门间，陌上浮云没马鞍。\n从此江西人勿论，夫君高只比庐山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42109,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"有怀故友张兼素 其三","author":"陈献章","text":"万里长安看我病，夜阑两马出携灯。\n如今只有西涯在，宿草江边露满茔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42110,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]